    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhwilsuba matetekhana nobusilu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilinde injendayo olwa oba notsiitsanga enanzu yaNyasaye; okhuba okhusita ahambi okhuhulila nokhulayi okhushila okhuhaana omusango kwabayingwa; okhuba bo shibamanya shinga olwa bakholanga obubii ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraboola amatetekhana nomunwakwo, kata omwoyokwo kuleshe okhwanguha okhurumbula likhuwa liosi imbeli waNyasaye ta; okhuba Nyasaye ali mwikulu, nawe oli mushialo; khulwako amakhuwako kabe amatuutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba lilooro liitsanga nokhutiika okhunji, nakwo omwoyo kwomuyingwa namakhuwa amanji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa omwitsubila Nyasaye eshiitsubo, orashinda okhushiusia; okhuba shiachama abayingwa ta; yusia akeenako aka weetsuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwakhaba bulayi obureetsuba ta, okhushila okhwitsuba mana noroosia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orafuchiilila omunwakwo okhuchila niwinjila mukhwonoona, kata oraboola imbeli womurume mbu libeele likosa, ta, shili heena eshiakhachila Nyasaye asinyishila omwoyokwo, kata okhusasia emilimo chiamakhonoko?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mubunji bwamalooro, nakobukhaya, amakhuwa keenjihanga; nebutswa iwe, riitsanga Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akobulamu buno namakhaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noba nolola mulukongo abamanani nibasandibungwa, nobuyaasii bwatoto niburusibwaho namaani, orahuka ta; okhuba ouli ikulu ahengungwa noundi oumushila; kata baliho abandi khandi abali ikulu okhubashila bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne neinganga eshialo okhuba nomuruchi, mbu eshialo shiemikunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouheela tsifeetsa shiyeekuranga tsifeetsa, kata ouheela obuyinda okhwikura amameeto ta; ako nako namakhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa emiandu chimeetekha, abachilia nabo bameetekha; kho kamukaasila shiina omwenechio, habula okhuchilola butswa netsimoni?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsindoolo tsiomukholi wemilimo netsimbuulu, kata naba naliitsanga ebitiiti kate ebinji; ne okhwikura khwomuyinda khumwikalila oburanyoola tsindoolo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buliho obubii bundi obukhongo obwa endolanga hasi weliuba; obwene mbwobuno, mbu obuyinda obubiikhwa nomwenebwo, niyeekhupia khushibii; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana nakosia obuyinda obwo khulwa obutiichi oburakaasa ta; ne naba nali nomwana owa yeebula, omwenoyo aba butswa amakhono amakhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinga olwa yarula munda yanyina, nolwa alitsia khandi ario, eshihechenye shinga olwa yeetsa; kata shialibukula eshindu shiosi khulwa emilimochie, eshia atsia ninashio mumukhono ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nalio nobubii obukhongo; mbu mumakhuwa kosi, shinga olwa yeetsa, nolwa alitsia ario; kho neinganga shiina eya aba ninayo, eyichila nanyakhanila omuyeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namala tsindaalotsie tsiosi mushiilima, naba neshibeela nobuteshele nobusinyishi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, aka ndaluutsi nikali amalayi, akakhoyeele, ngakano; mbu omundu okhuliitsanga nokhunywa nokhusangaalila emilimochie chiosi echia akholanga hasi weliuba, tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe etsia Nyasaye yemuheelesiye, kata olwa tsili tsinduutu; okhuba okwo nikwo omukabokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata buli mundu yesi owa Nyasaye yaheelesiye emiandu nobuyinda, namuheele nende obunyali okhuliitsangakhwo, nokhubukula omukabokwe, nokhwikhoyela emilimochie--ako nako neshihaanwa shiaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba shialiitsulilanga muno tsindaalo tsiobulamubwe ta, shichila Nyasaye yeetsusinjia ebisebie omwikhoyo okwomumwoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
